<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/05e6ea85be49> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] Andrew Thomas Hayler pleaded guilty to 28 counts of using a carriage service to cause offence involving 26 women between July 2020 and August 2022, including his close friends, former housemates and colleagues." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4366" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/063db904256b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hannah needed legal support when she faced a push back from the police who were handling her case." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/19b0708bbc44> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4374] After lengthy legal proceedings, the accused was sentenced to nine years imprisonment, with a non-parole period of 5.5 years, by Judge Culver in the District Court at the Downing Centre." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/21983907a474> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] Andrew Thomas Hayler pleaded guilty to 28 counts of using a carriage service to cause offence involving 26 women between July 2020 and August 2022, including his close friends, former housemates and colleagues." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4366" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/278bd52810c2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] She asked her partner Kris to open the link for her while she watched on. [4366] It became more and more obvious that it was our friend Andy, said Kris." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4366" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/296d8b404d04> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The case of Hannah Grundy, our client, has gained national attention after it was recently featured in Australian Story: Betrayal." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2cc18beb567a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "How a young Aussie teacher became the target of vile deepfake images" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4375" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/399e61c3c5cb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "When she showed it to her partner, Kris Ventura, he agreed that it was \"probably a scam\" but their interest was piqued." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4373" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/45134507d754> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] When science teacher Hannah Grundy started receiving emails from a stranger called John Doe, she assumed it was a scam and decided to ignore them. [4375] Hannah Grundy received a series of anonymous emails in February 2022 warning several pornographic images of her had been shared on a website." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4366" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5aaaffe6ace9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hannah found deepfake porn of herself online. But the most disturbing revelation was still to come" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4373" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5deead5fed55> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Jessica Stuart, who had considered Hayler a \"close friend\", spoke about the horror of learning he had shared photographs of her plastered with degrading comments." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4373" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/609766397d6d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4375] 6 women fronted Hayler in court to described how his weaponised usage of deepfakes had impacted their lives with one, Jessica Stuart, saying he'd 'incited a whole community of predators against us'. [4373] Jessica Stuart, who had considered Hayler a \"close friend\", spoke about the horror of learning he had shared photographs of her plastered with degrading comments." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4375" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/661bd8b6353c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Hannah Grundy had received from a mysterious internet stranger who called herself \"Sally\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4373" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8af99a803bff> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Justice for Hannah Grundy – A Landmark Victory Against Online Abuse For Our Client" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9e57874712ec> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] 1 was Rachel McGinty and another was Jessica Stuart, who had both worked at a university bar with Hannah and her partner Kris, and were part of their tight-knit friendship group. [4373] Rachel McGinty described finding out that Hayler had created a thread on the website called \"Let's r*pe Rachel\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4373" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/a886b441b977> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4374] After lengthy legal proceedings, the accused was sentenced to nine years imprisonment, with a non-parole period of 5.5 years, by Judge Culver in the District Court at the Downing Centre." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4374" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ad610aa9f9b7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[4366] Andrew Thomas Hayler pleaded guilty to 28 counts of using a carriage service to cause offence involving 26 women between July 2020 and August 2022, including his close friends, former housemates and colleagues." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4366" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/afbe7654b783> a airo:Evidence ;
